{
  "description": "Fingerprint cases (sourceSchemaVersion 1). Expected hashes were computed with coreutils sha256sum on the canonical string written by hand (printf '%s' 'GRAMMAR<US>1<US>…' | sha256sum), not with either implementation. Python (test_contrast_tools.py) and Kotlin (ContrastSharedFixturesTest) must both reproduce them.",
